- The BSP `BSP_LCD_Init` calls `LcdDrv->Init()` (ILI9341) which uses SPI5 and LTDC? It configures the ILI9341 in RGB mode. Good.
- `BSP_LCD_SetLayerVisible(0, ENABLE)` uses `__HAL_LTDC_LAYER_ENABLE` and reload. Good.

