Need to ensure the LTDC layer 0 is enabled and layer 1 disabled. `HAL_LTDC_ConfigLayer` enables layer 0. Layer 1 remains disabled by default after `HAL_LTDC_Init`. Good.
- The BSP `BSP_LCD_Init` calls `BSP_LCD_SetFont(&LCD_DEFAULT_FONT)` and `BSP_SDRAM_Init`. Fine.
- The BSP `BSP_LCD_Init` calls `LcdDrv->Init()` which configures ILI9341; it may set the panel's pixel format to RGB interface. Fine.
