Possibility: the MBR write went to the wrong LBA. `HAL_SD_WriteBlocks_DMA(&hsd, (uint8_t *)mbr, 0U, 1U)`. For SDHC cards, HAL passes block address directly. LBA 0. Fine.

Possibility: the card has a write-protect group? No.

